comes (26.501583ms)\n✔ the output block carries a generator repair line for every mirror check (5.391333ms)\n✔ agent body parity output names the real-file and generated mirror repairs (5.488375ms)\n✔ the route stays read-only and never runs a mirror generator in write mode (9.018916ms)\n✔ the contract fails when a mirror line is removed from the route (133.12025ms)\n✔ the contract fails when a mirror asset, step or repair line leaves the workflow (39.558041ms)\n✔ the contract fails when a step loses its n/a rule or names no surface (7.860167ms)\n✔ doctor setup prints the orphan summary as informational output (0.398834ms)\nℹ tests 10\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 10\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 766.203541\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-runtime-mirrors-contract.test.cjs .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-setup-orphan-line.test.cjs 2>&1 | tail -25\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794539623736,"end":1794539624672}}}}
