{"type":"text","timestamp":1794539643012,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1e00b7ffeXYNr5JwmmzZPgF","part":{"id":"prt_1d2e5d365001OY9yJdzsGVTwpZ","sessionID":"ses_e2d1e00b7ffeXYNr5JwmmzZPgF","messageID":"msg_1d2e5bbad0017QZi7XxrHl4ZcK","type":"text","text":"T004 is implemented and all three verify commands pass.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs` adds `COLLAPSE_ALLOWLIST`, exports `commandVisibility` and `collapseDrift`, appends collapse lines to `drift`, and prints the visibility line before the PASS line.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/sync-runtime-mirrors.test.mjs` imports both helpers and adds the two cases: the 2/3 Claude and 3/3 Cursor visibility with no drift, and the `design/skill.md` collapse.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`node --test .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/sync-runtime-mirrors.test.mjs`:\n```\n✔ counts what each runtime shows and allows the known create collapse (0.377458ms)\n✔ flags a command folder whose skill.md hides its siblings on Claude Code (0.304709ms)\nℹ tests 8\nℹ pass 8\nℹ fail 0\n```\n\n`node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs --check`:\n```\n[runtime-mirror-sync] visibility claude 32/44, cursor 44/44\n[runtime-mirror-sync] PASS: 256 mirrors across 10 trees are in sync.\nexit=0\n```\n\n`node --test $DS/tests/doctor-runtime-mirrors-contract.test.cjs $DS/tests/doctor-setup-orphan-line.test.cjs`:\n```\nℹ tests 10\nℹ pass 10\nℹ fail 0\n```\n\nThe 44 total excludes the root-level `local-skilled-alignment.md` command because Claude Code has no folder to collapse there. That omission is what makes the printed count 44 rather than 45.\n\nNothing was left undone. I did not tick the task checkbox and did not rebuild any dist output, since the task named no build step.","time":{"start":1794539639653,"end":1794539643012}}}
